ored as printed. The Nightbane Sorcerer and Nightbane Mystic entries (printed 119-120) restate the race''s P.P.E. as 3D6x10+20 plus P.E. with +2D6+6 per level; the two printings disagree on the per-level gain, and when both halves state a pool the race''s is kept, so a paired character receives this one. TALENTS: printed 87 and 106. Only the purchase allowance (two per level, from level one) is stored here, because it holds for every Nightbane including the Sorcerer and Mystic; the free Talents (one at level one, one more at 4, 7, 10 and 12) belong on the four package O.C.C.s, and the Sorcerer''s and Mystic''s own free schedules on theirs, because a race''s and an occupation''s talent grants are added together, not chosen between. HORROR FACTOR: the Facade has none, so no class-level horror_factor; the 6-18 lives in second_form. The Becoming''s M.E. save, nightvision ranges, sense range, regeneration, the Morphus''s martial arts and Supernatural P.S. damage, and the Mirror Walk''s costs are prose in natural_abilities. Immunity to mind control is prose rather than a save bonus. PSIONICS: none, stored as psionics_allowed false."
